  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15 New. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16; ss by #11018, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-7-16, EXPIRES: 7-5-16; ss by #11135, eff 7-2-16",
